      "ordinal": 58,
      "label": "sdc02_0110_brother_12",
      "hash64": "21B37E74C277DB51",
      "text": "......[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "label": "sdc02_0110_fairybb_08",
      "hash64": "99B2052E37E9E59B",
      "text": "앗, 카지![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "label": "sdc02_0110_fairybb_09",
      "hash64": "99B2042E37E9E3E8",
      "text": "야! 제빈!\\n그런 건 옳지 않다구![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "label": "sdc02_0110_dragonbb_27",
      "hash64": "23A6E69E05C99DE4",
      "text": "미안하게 됐어, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "label": "sdc02_0110_dragonbb_28",
      "hash64": "23A6DD9E05C98E99",
      "text": "얘기하다 보니 그냥\\n블루베리그에 참가하는 게 돼 버렸네.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "label": "sdc02_0110_dragonbb_29",
      "hash64": "23A6DC9E05C98CE6",
      "text": "뭐, 어떤 의미로 보자면\\n카지와 친목을 다질 기회가 되지 않겠어!?[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "label": "sdc02_0110_dragonbb_30",
      "hash64": "23A3DF9E05C75C28",
      "text": "내가 확실하게 서포트해 줄 테니까\\n너무 걱정하지 말라고.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "label": "sdc02_0110_dragonbb_31",
      "hash64": "23A3E09E05C75DDB",
      "text": "그럼, 결정됐으니\\n정식으로 엔트리하러 가 볼까?[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "label": "sdc02_0110_dragonbb_32",
      "hash64": "23A3E19E05C75F8E",
      "text": "입구에 있는 접수처로 가자.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "label": "sdc02_0110_dragonbb_33",
      "hash64": "23A3E29E05C76141",
      "text": "헤헤헷, 왔구나!\\n여기서 엔트리하면 돼.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
